<section class="section" aria-labelledby="princ-h">
  <h2 class="section__head" id="princ-h">How I work</h2>
  <ol class="principles section__body">
    <li>
      <h3 class="principles__head">A match nobody can justify is worse than a gap everybody can see.</h3>
      <p>Ambiguous records go to review. Resolving them silently makes the
        report look cleaner and the data worse.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h3 class="principles__head">Report the analysis you could do, not the one you planned.</h3>
      <p>When the data would not support a 30-sample interval on the
        constraint I wanted, I relaxed the constraint and said so in the
        write-up.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h3 class="principles__head">Write the criteria down before scoring anything.</h3>
      <p>Rubrics, data dictionaries and validation rules are all the same
        instinct: decide what counts before you look at the answer.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h3 class="principles__head">A number without its reasoning attached does not survive an argument.</h3>
      <p>Which is the point of publishing the method next to the finding.</p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="approach-h">
  <h2 class="section__head" id="approach-h">How I approach a problem</h2>
  <ol class="numbered steps section__body">
    <li>
      <div class="steps__row">
        <p class="entry__numeral" aria-hidden="true">01</p>
        <div class="steps__main">
          <h3 class="steps__title">Define the problem.</h3>
          <p class="steps__body">What are we actually trying to determine?</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <div class="steps__row">
        <p class="entry__numeral" aria-hidden="true">02</p>
        <div class="steps__main">
          <h3 class="steps__title">Establish criteria.</h3>
          <p class="steps__body">What would make an answer correct or useful?</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <div class="steps__row">
        <p class="entry__numeral" aria-hidden="true">03</p>
        <div class="steps__main">
          <h3 class="steps__title">Investigate.</h3>
          <p class="steps__body">Find the relevant data, assumptions, and constraints.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <div class="steps__row">
        <p class="entry__numeral" aria-hidden="true">04</p>
        <div class="steps__main">
          <h3 class="steps__title">Validate.</h3>
          <p class="steps__body">Check the result against the source, logic, or another method.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <div class="steps__row">
        <p class="entry__numeral" aria-hidden="true">05</p>
        <div class="steps__main">
          <h3 class="steps__title">Communicate.</h3>
          <p class="steps__body">Explain the conclusion clearly, including uncertainty when it matters.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>

